@startuml SE_11_StartConsultation
title Sequence Diagram: SE_11 Bắt đầu phiên khám bệnh
actor "Bác sĩ" as Doctor
participant "View\n(DoctorQueueActivity)" as View
participant "QueueController" as Controller
participant "QueueEventService" as Service
participant "CheckInQueueRepository" as Repo
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Doctor -> View: Gọi bệnh nhân tiếp theo
activate View
View -> Controller: callNextPatient(roomId)
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: processCallNext(roomId)
activate Service
Service -> Repo: findTopByRoomIdOrderByPriority(...)
Repo -> DB: SELECT * FROM check_in_queue...
DB --> Repo: queueEntity
Service -> DB: UPDATE check_in_queue SET status='SERVING'
Service --> Controller: PatientInfo
Controller --> View: 200 OK
View --> Doctor: Hiển thị hồ sơ bệnh nhân (EMR)
deactivate View
@enduml